  "summary": {
    "text": "Nemotron Nano 2 VL is a 12B open-weights vision-language model from NVIDIA that takes text, images and video and produces text, built on the Nemotron Nano 2 12B reasoning model with a RADIO vision encoder. NVIDIA presents it for document, multi-image and video understanding; it introduced Efficient Video Sampling and was offered on Hugging Face, build.nvidia.com and as an NVIDIA NIM.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "id": "src.nvidia.nemotron-vision-rag-guardrail-models-blog"
