  "notes": "NVIDIA names Llama-3.1-Nemotron-Nano-VL-8B-V1 (June 2025) as its previous vision-language model; that model is out of scope, so no successor-of relation is recorded. The technical report says context grew from 16K in that model to 128K. BF16, FP8 and NVFP4-QAD are precision checkpoints, kept as aliases; the technical report names the weights Nemotron-Nano-12B-v2-VL and build.nvidia.com uses NVIDIA-Nemotron-Nano-VL-12B-V2. The Hugging Face repositories were created on 2025-10-21 and 2025-10-22 (Hugging Face API); the model card gives October 28th, 2025 as the release date."
